    "summary": "Errata to the Catacomb Command Barge. It gains the **NOBLE** keyword, and its **Resurrection Orb** changes:\n\n- Once per battle, as any phase ends, you may pick up to 1 friendly **NECRONS INFANTRY** or **NECRONS MOUNTED** unit that is within 6″ of the Barge to **resurrect**.\n- A unit that **resurrects** activates its [Reanimation Protocols](vsdata:ability/necrons.reanimation-protocols) but **heals** D6 wounds rather than D3.\n- No more than 1 unit may **resurrect** per turn.",
